{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2023-09", "window": 4, "start_date": 1695427200, "end_date": 1696118399, "month_true_total": 95, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:52:38 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "147391693", "author": {"steamid": "76561198008847822", "personaname": "Shlean", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198008847822/", "num_games_owned": 484, "num_reviews": 41, "playtime_forever": 1341, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 434, "last_played": 1718928489, "avatar": "1046833fa7e18a13d4ebd7e3b401131b6ee54b12"}, "language": "english", "review": "Its not a balanced game currently, but that can change at release.   Its still fun and for the price worth picking up.  There isn't that much variety in guns or builds, and getting one of the few good guns (or hitscan mod) is necessary to finish a run.  I've beat it a few times and I enjoy it still.   The classes aren't balanced, but are still fun.", "timestamp_created": 1696113183, "timestamp_updated": 1696113183, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "147384970", "author": {"steamid": "76561198982564476", "personaname": "Arsimursu", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Arsimursu/", "num_games_owned": 213, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 1637, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1473, "last_played": 1740778993, "avatar": "b978088475115992c97faecfcf882c028827ee1a"}, "language": "english", "review": "good game but resetted the progress and its annoying", "timestamp_created": 1696105832, "timestamp_updated": 1709399365, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "147381949", "author": {"steamid": "76561198051888147", "personaname": "photosynthesis", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198051888147/", "num_games_owned": 57, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 4796, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1626, "last_played": 1739071755, "avatar": "d61dbff3ad80e8a7d368ccb89bd6e28cda193c84"}, "language": "english", "review": "Movement and gunplay is very crisp, roguelike elements are fantastic giving different approaches that all feel powerful.   The progression systems feel good to work towards without taking too long to get to a strong state. As a Gunfire Reborn fanboy I think the replayability of Roboquest after maxing progress is a bit weaker due to a lack of variance in gameplay experience depending on weapon finds during a run and how those interact with your character selection and build. Finding cool weapons tends to just make you generally \"better\" instead of opening new ways to approach fights. \n\nAlso the music goes incredibly hard.\n\nOverall I would highly recommend the game. I thought the price was well justified in much earlier stages of the game and \nupdates along the way have given me confidence in the dev team both to execute on 1.0 well and continue support beyond.", "timestamp_created": 1696102885, "timestamp_updated": 1696102885, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "147329296", "autho